              <p class="validation-title">Time to first useful interaction</p>
              <p class="validation-value">~10 min → ~3 min</p>
              <p class="validation-note">Estimated from the prototype flow.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="validation-item">
              <p class="validation-title">Next-action clarity</p>
              <p class="validation-note">Users understood what to do next from the first home screen.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="validation-item">
              <p class="validation-title">Account-opening timing</p>
              <p class="validation-note">Users recognized full account opening as a contextual next step, not an upfront blocker.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="validation-item">
              <p class="validation-title">Transfer confirmation clarity</p>
              <p class="validation-note">Users understood that scheduled transfers would not be sent without confirmation.</p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

